WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.725
Identify, explain and apply the important ideas behind sitting safely at a computer.

00:00:06.533 --> 00:00:11.729
Short breaks: allow eyes and muscles to rest. Comfortable seat: supports a healthy

00:00:11.729 --> 00:00:12.528
sitting position.

00:00:13.367 --> 00:00:18.666
Screen distance: helps prevent eye strain. Dry hands: reduce electrical risk near

00:00:18.666 --> 00:00:22.199
devices. Tidy cables: help prevent trips and falls.

00:00:23.033 --> 00:00:27.698
Create a class safety demonstration. Show a good example of short breaks and

00:00:27.698 --> 00:00:30.927
comfortable seat and explain why the good practice matters.
